{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好厲害喔，又變大了。」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2082", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，會癢嗎？為了讓妳變得更大更大，我會一直摸摸喔！」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2083", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "pn0409", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵吃得好多，所以越變越大了呢～」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2084", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼啊……我也想被那樣摸摸。特別是胸部，想讓學姊幫我變大～」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "sn1609", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳在說什麼傻話。胸部有現在的大小就夠了吧。」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar4465", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是對B罩杯的我的挑戰嗎？」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "sn1610", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原來她是B罩杯啊。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，你剛才笑了吧？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "sn1611", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有笑、沒有笑。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是用手蓋住嘴巴就被懷疑了。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼那麼，小紗同學就由本人安潔來摸摸吧！嘿咿～」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "ag3451", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「胸部快～點～變～大～B罩杯絕種吧～」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "ag3452", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "sn1612", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎麼看都是反效果。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理也想被摸摸嗎？」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 368, "voice": "sk1331", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……問之前妳不就摸了？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "ar4466", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 368, "voice": "sk1332", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "社團教室裡到處都摸摸了起來。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵，就算妳用腳這樣踩踩，我也不會有母乳喔～」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2085", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "pn0410", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總有一天，我會讓她產母乳的！", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我暗自下了決心。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老實說，被美羽學姊摸摸之後真的會變成那種表情。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨晚，我在學姊的房間也是那樣。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你幹嘛從剛才開始就一直賊笑？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "sn1613", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為昨天第一次被「用嘴巴舔乾淨」了！", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我說不出口。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺好和平呢。」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "搬出這個正大光明的理由，我可以堂堂正正地賊笑了。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇，天都黑了。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2086", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天也辛苦了。」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，新吾君也辛苦了～」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2087", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天遲遲沒有兩人獨處的機會，一回過神來已經這麼晚了。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊還是一樣，在大家面前是個可靠的社長。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，兩人獨處的時候……", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君，在社團教室裡被大家摸摸很開心吧～？」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2088", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "變成只屬於我的女朋友。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個轉換太絕妙，只要是男人，一定都受不了女性的這種反差。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒辦法被美羽學姊摸摸，感覺很寂寞。」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那現在來摸摸你吧♪」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2089", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊踮起腳尖，伸手放到我頭上。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也摸摸學姊吧。」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「摸我頭的新吾君露出像爸爸一樣的表情。討厭，你絕對把我當成小孩子了吧～？」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2090", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就做只有女朋友能做的事情吧。」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2091", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯！？啾、嗯嗯、嗯……啾……嗯……哈啊……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2092", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "出奇不意地奪走她的唇，在臉頰和額頭也烙下我的印記。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們凝視彼此，沉浸在此時此刻。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……感覺臉變得好熱喔。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2093", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是說啊，明明外面那麼冷。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吶，今天也要來我家嗎？」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2094", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以嗎？」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。在社團教室裡沒辦法摸摸的份，回家後盡情幫你摸摸喔！」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2095", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那個摸摸該不會是……", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學、學姊……」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔啊！？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，今天也射出來好多喔……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2096", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾君，不要摸摸了嗎？」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2097", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「已、已經不行了……」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就幫你清乾淨喔。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2098", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊姆、啾、嗯嗯、啾、嗯、哈啊、啾、嗯、嗶啾、嗯、啾唔……」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2099", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊、學姊……咿……」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊用新學會的「清潔技巧」對付我的傢伙，然後抬起眼眸看我。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這種時候，看到她臉上沒有任何厭惡的表情，就能深深感覺到自己是被愛著的呢。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果我是女人，叫我做同樣的事情大概沒辦法。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……還好嗎？新吾君的又變大了喔……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2100", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……學姊，可以吻妳嗎？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？可是我、嘴巴裡有新吾君的……嗯嗯！？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2101", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾、嗯嗯、哈啊、啾、嗯嗯、啾、啾、啾……」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2102", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "疼愛過我的傢伙的嘴唇，是如此的惹人憐愛。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊總是想讓我舒服，她自己卻什麼也不要求。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看我達到高潮，她就打從心底高興。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，新吾君的嘴唇好軟喔♪」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2103", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊的才是。」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、啾、嗯嗯、啾、嗯嗯……嗯……啾……」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2104", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們吸吮著對方的嘴唇，分享彼此的氣味。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊的甜香充盈我的鼻腔，蓬鬆柔軟的頭髮搔癢了我的臉頰。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不想和她分開，不想回家。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "讓我產生這些念頭的，學姊的危險香氣。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊，不用送我了啦。」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是天色暗了我會擔心。新吾君這麼可愛，好像會被可怕的女人襲擊……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2105", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這附近哪有那種人……」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，新吾同學要回去了嗎？我開車送你到半路吧？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0176", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是有這種可怕的女人，所以才擔心啊。」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2106", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結子小姐突如其來的登場讓我心臟狂跳。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近你都只陪美羽，已經不愛我了啊……」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0177", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還擅自開始營造禁忌不倫戀的氣氛了。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吼唷，媽媽不要說傻話了！新吾君會困擾的。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2107", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可愛男孩子困擾的模樣，是人妻的最愛喔♪」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0178", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2108", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽也喜歡那樣的新吾同學不是嗎？」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0179", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我……」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2109", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女人這種生物啊，都會想要讓新吾君這種正經的男性哭哭喔♪」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0180", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2110", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉喔，新吾同學，我女兒這麼變態個性又差勁。」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0181", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸欸！媽媽太狡猾了啦，明明是妳自己說的！」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2111", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "變態的美羽學姊正好。會如此想的我也蠻可悲的。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「媽媽，妳是特地來戲弄我們的嗎？」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2112", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然有一部份是，但其實是有點在意不久前聽到的熊喵小姐的叫聲。」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0182", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但或許是我聽錯了……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0183", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2113", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，這麼說來我昨天很晚的時候也聽到了熊喵的叫聲。」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然那個時候沒有看到牠的身影……」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 364, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2114", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在社團看到熊喵的時候牠都很有精神，我覺得應該不用擔心，但美羽學姊似乎不這麼想。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那媽媽要回去了，美羽也別太晚回家喔。」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0184", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……為什麼要帶新吾君一起走？」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 378, "voice": "mu2115", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "結子", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結子", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "yk0185", "char_id": "結子"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_24.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近，我開始覺得結子小姐的這個笑容有點可怕……", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
